        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Bath Towel, 2/2 cotton twill with weft loops embroidered with silk and metal thread. The silk embroidery is worked in double running stitches including double running filling stitch combinations.  The metal thread embroidery is worked in double darning on the diagonal and in plate in slanted satin stitch.\nThere are no minor borders, each end is decorated with a landscape depicting the Golden Horn in Istanbul.  In the forground are low hills with trees, two of which are very tall, and some buildings.  There are many small rowing boats on the water and in the background are more hills and trees."@en ;
